    "Whatever is still lying on the table at the end goes to whoever took last. That one is not a scopa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce qui reste sur la table à la fin revient à qui a pris en dernier — et cela ne compte pas comme une scopa."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quel che resta sul tavolo alla fine va a chi ha preso per ultimo. Quella non è una scopa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When everyone has played their three, three more are dealt, and again, until the deck is empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quand chacun a joué ses trois cartes, on en redonne trois, et ainsi de suite jusqu'à épuisement du talon."
